OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early showers tending to
OL,6,Fdie out in the far west. Otherwise a
OL,7,Fbright and chilly start, with patchy
OL,8,Ffrost and fog in rural spots, and a
OL,9,Flargely dry and sunny day ahead.
OL,10,FBreezy along coastlines, and feeling
OL,11,Fchilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry and mostly clear during
OL,14,Fthe evening and overnight, with rural
OL,15,Ffrost and fog forming by dawn as the
OL,16,Fchilly feel continues. Breezy in some
OL,17,Feastern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,172,160,301,260,100,100
