OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F171A1792210672
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother dry and fairly sunny
OL,6,Fday for many, although increasing
OL,7,Fcloud in the east may bring some
OL,8,Fpatchy rain here heading into the
OL,9,Fevening. Temperatures still below
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FOrganised showers move westwards
OL,14,Facross the region through Monday,
OL,15,Fclearing later. A dry interlude
OL,16,Ffollows, before more rain develops on
OL,17,FTuesday and Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,18,Fnearer average, though possibly windy
OL,19,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
